{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01H6eMoeGyNwtuaFstEd5VLt","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t(ns yin.vm.ucf.rows-support\n2\t  \"Test support for the row carrier under custody (phase 7a): real\n3\t   semantic-register machines the engine parks, the composition's source\n4\t   index, a deterministic exporter, the custody header parts and `lift`,\n5\t   rows/lift-task over one machine. It mirrors yin.vm.ucf.lift-support,\n6\t   whose AST helpers, one-slot streams, exporter and header parts it\n7\t   reuses, over yin.vm.semantic-register instead of the old kernel.\n8\t\n9\t   Every pack the 7a tests and the rows checkpoint fixtures check comes\n10\t   out of `lift`, never from a hand-built map. The one thing set by hand\n11\t   is an operation id on a wait entry (`with-op-id`), as in lift-support.\n12\t   The streams carry no random identity and `serve-table` answers s0, s1\n13\t   ... in first-asked order, so a pack's bytes are the same on every run\n14\t   and host.\"\n15\t  (:require [dao.jing :as jing]\n16\t            [dao.stream :as stream]\n17\t            [dao.stream.ringbuffer :as ringbuffer]\n18\t            [yin.vm :as vm]\n19\t            [yin.vm.engine :as engine]\n20\t            [yin.vm.ledger :as ledger]\n21\t            [yin.vm.module :as module]\n22\t            [yin.vm.semantic-register :as sr]\n23\t            [yin.vm.semantic-register.code :as code]\n24\t            [yin.vm.semantic-register.linearize :as linearize]\n25\t            [yin.vm.test-utils :as tu]\n26\t            [yin.vm.ucf.lift-support :as ls]\n27\t            [yin.vm.ucf.rows :as rows]\n28\t            [yin.vm.values :as values]))\n29\t\n30\t\n31\t;; =============================================================================\n32\t;; The composition: code by A and the source index\n33\t;; =============================================================================\n34\t\n35\t(def source-index\n36\t  \"The composition's {A #{tree-address}} (continuation §6.1): every vector\n37\t   `project` makes is recorded beside the address of its AST.\"\n38\t  (atom {}))\n39\t\n40\t\n41\t(defn project\n42\t  [ast]\n43\t  (let [v (:vector (linearize/project ast))]\n44\t    (swap! source-index update (jing/segment-key v) (fnil conj #{}) (jing/segment-key [:yin/tree ast]))\n45\t    v))\n46\t\n47\t\n48\t(def lit ls/lit)\n49\t(def v ls/v)\n50\t(def lam ls/lam)\n51\t(def app ls/app)\n52\t(def then ls/then)\n53\t(def let1 ls/let1)\n54\t(def def! ls/def!)\n55\t(def cursor-of ls/cursor-of)\n56\t(def next-of ls/next-of)\n57\t(def one-slot-stream ls/one-slot-stream)\n58\t(def serve-table ls/serve-table)\n59\t(def with-op-id ls/with-op-id)\n60\t(def occurrence ls/occurrence)\n61\t(def predecessor ls/predecessor)\n62\t(def origin ls/origin)\n63\t(def arbitration ls/arbitration)\n64\t(def op-id ls/op-id)\n65\t(def header ls/header)\n66\t\n67\t\n68\t(defn- ring\n69\t  [capacity]\n70\t  (:dao.stream/handle\n71\t    (ringbuffer/create! {:dao.stream/type ringbuffer/transport-type ringbuffer/capacity-key capacity})))\n72\t\n73\t\n74\t(defn- make-det-stream\n75\t  []\n76\t  (let [n (atom 0)]\n77\t    (fn [_capacity]\n78\t      {:dao.stream/outcome :dao.stream/ok\n79\t       :dao.stream/handle (one-slot-stream (str \"made-\" (swap! n inc)))})))\n80\t\n81\t\n82\t(def stream-modules (module/register-stream-module (module/default-registry)))\n83\t\n84\t\n85\t(defn new-machine\n86\t  ([] (new-machine {}))\n87\t  ([opts]\n88\t   (sr/create-vm (merge {:make-stream (make-det-stream)\n89\t                         :capability-secret tu/secret\n90\t                         :modules stream-modules\n91\t                         :secret-source (fn [origin] (str tu/secret \"/\" (name origin)))}\n92\t                        opts))))\n93\t\n94\t\n95\t(defn load-ast\n96\t  [machine ast]\n97\t  (sr/load-vector machine (project ast) code/contract))\n98\t\n99\t\n100\t;; =============================================================================\n101\t;; Machines\n102\t;; =============================================================================\n103\t\n104\t(defn parked-reader\n105\t  \"Parked on the second read of the stream it makes, A consumed: one :next\n106\t   wait over one cursor cell.\"\n107\t  []\n108\t  (let [m0 (vm/run (load-ast (new-machine)\n109\t                             (let1 's {:type :stream/make :buffer 4}\n110\t                                   (let1 'c (cursor-of (v 's))\n111\t                                         (then (next-of (v 'c)) (next-of (v 'c)))))))\n112\t        src (get (:resources m0) (:stream-id (first (:wait-set m0))))]\n113\t    (stream/append! src \"A\")\n114\t    (vm/run m0)))\n115\t\n116\t\n117\t(defn parked-writer\n118\t  \"Parked on a blocked write: the warm one-slot stream keeps the value\n119\t   retained. One :put wait.\"\n120\t  []"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c88f8d87-995f-4b00-89ec-984c8c9878f0","uuid":"1d4cde2c-5567-4cfa-b76b-a01fb9904a1b","timestamp":"2026-10-13T18:38:21.335Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld-srvm-p7d/test/yin/vm/ucf/rows_support.cljc","content":"(ns yin.vm.ucf.rows-support\n  \"Test support for the row carrier under custody (phase 7a): real\n   semantic-register machines the engine parks, the composition's source\n   index, a deterministic exporter, the custody header parts and `lift`,\n   rows/lift-task over one machine. It mirrors yin.vm.ucf.lift-support,\n   whose AST helpers, one-slot streams, exporter and header parts it\n   reuses, over yin.vm.semantic-register instead of the old kernel.\n\n   Every pack the 7a tests and the rows checkpoint fixtures check comes\n   out of `lift`, never from a hand-built map. The one thing set by hand\n   is an operation id on a wait entry (`with-op-id`), as in lift-support.\n   The streams carry no random identity and `serve-table` answers s0, s1\n   ... in first-asked order, so a pack's bytes are the same on every run\n   and host.\"\n  (:require [dao.jing :as jing]\n            [dao.stream :as stream]\n            [dao.stream.ringbuffer :as ringbuffer]\n            [yin.vm :as vm]\n            [yin.vm.engine :as engine]\n            [yin.vm.ledger :as ledger]\n            [yin.vm.module :as module]\n            [yin.vm.semantic-register :as sr]\n            [yin.vm.semantic-register.code :as code]\n            [yin.vm.semantic-register.linearize :as linearize]\n            [yin.vm.test-utils :as tu]\n            [yin.vm.ucf.lift-support :as ls]\n            [yin.vm.ucf.rows :as rows]\n            [yin.vm.values :as values]))\n\n\n;; =============================================================================\n;; The composition: code by A and the source index\n;; =============================================================================\n\n(def source-index\n  \"The composition's {A #{tree-address}} (continuation §6.1): every vector\n   `project` makes is recorded beside the address of its AST.\"\n  (atom {}))\n\n\n(defn project\n  [ast]\n  (let [v (:vector (linearize/project ast))]\n    (swap! source-index update (jing/segment-key v) (fnil conj #{}) (jing/segment-key [:yin/tree ast]))\n    v))\n\n\n(def lit ls/lit)\n(def v ls/v)\n(def lam ls/lam)\n(def app ls/app)\n(def then ls/then)\n(def let1 ls/let1)\n(def def! ls/def!)\n(def cursor-of ls/cursor-of)\n(def next-of ls/next-of)\n(def one-slot-stream ls/one-slot-stream)\n(def serve-table ls/serve-table)\n(def with-op-id ls/with-op-id)\n(def occurrence ls/occurrence)\n(def predecessor ls/predecessor)\n(def origin ls/origin)\n(def arbitration ls/arbitration)\n(def op-id ls/op-id)\n(def header ls/header)\n\n\n(defn- ring\n  [capacity]\n  (:dao.stream/handle\n    (ringbuffer/create! {:dao.stream/type ringbuffer/transport-type ringbuffer/capacity-key capacity})))\n\n\n(defn- make-det-stream\n  []\n  (let [n (atom 0)]\n    (fn [_capacity]\n      {:dao.stream/outcome :dao.stream/ok\n       :dao.stream/handle (one-slot-stream (str \"made-\" (swap! n inc)))})))\n\n\n(def stream-modules (module/register-stream-module (module/default-registry)))\n\n\n(defn new-machine\n  ([] (new-machine {}))\n  ([opts]\n   (sr/create-vm (merge {:make-stream (make-det-stream)\n                         :capability-secret tu/secret\n                         :modules stream-modules\n                         :secret-source (fn [origin] (str tu/secret \"/\" (name origin)))}\n                        opts))))\n\n\n(defn load-ast\n  [machine ast]\n  (sr/load-vector machine (project ast) code/contract))\n\n\n;; =============================================================================\n;; Machines\n;; =============================================================================\n\n(defn parked-reader\n  \"Parked on the second read of the stream it makes, A consumed: one :next\n   wait over one cursor cell.\"\n  []\n  (let [m0 (vm/run (load-ast (new-machine)\n                             (let1 's {:type :stream/make :buffer 4}\n                                   (let1 'c (cursor-of (v 's))\n                                         (then (next-of (v 'c)) (next-of (v 'c)))))))\n        src (get (:resources m0) (:stream-id (first (:wait-set m0))))]\n    (stream/append! src \"A\")\n    (vm/run m0)))\n\n\n(defn parked-writer\n  \"Parked on a blocked write: the warm one-slot stream keeps the value\n   retained. One :put wait.\"\n  []","numLines":120,"startLine":1,"totalLines":296}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01H6eMoeGyNwtuaFstEd5VLt","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
